  Aspen is a notation for security protocols.  Despite the many
  publications and textbooks found using notations for security
  protocols, the notations used are not consistent. The motivation for
  Aspen is to have an expressive and consistent notation that can
  be used in different settings where security protocols are
  presented.  The \texttt{aspen} package implements this notation for
  {\LaTeX}.  Optionally, the \texttt{aspen} package also provides the
  \acro{BAN} logic notation.
